{
  "//": "Story Phase 2, chapter 4: The Grumblegut Gust. The blast, then cutaways to the rooms above (crew quarters, galley, deck, the ship from afar), then back to the ruined treasure room.",

  "ch4.door_struggle": {
    "start": [
      { "move": "garrick", "path": ["down", 1, "left", 1], "speed": "run" },
      { "sfx": "slip" },
      { "hop": "garrick", "height": 12, "duration": 300 },
      { "fly": "garrick", "to": [12, 11], "arc": 10, "duration": 420 },
      { "sfx": "thud_heavy" },
      { "sfx": "chest_creak" },
      { "shake": 3, "duration": 300 },
      { "burst": "splinters", "x": 12, "y": 11, "count": 10 },
      { "burst": "coins", "x": 13, "y": 11, "count": 10 },
      { "propFx": "jiggle", "prop": "chest_moved", "duration": 400, "intensity": 2 },
      "Garrick slips on a stray doubloon, windmills once, and lands backside-first on the chest you just moved. It gives an ominous crack.",
      "garrick[gastro]: Captain... I regret to inform you...",
      "garrick[gastro]: ...that my digestive system has declared bankruptcy.",
      "captain[alarmed]: The DOOR!",
      { "move": "player", "to": [9, 12], "face": "down", "speed": "run" },
      { "sfx": "door_rattle" },
      { "wait": 300 },
      { "sfx": "crab_snap" },
      { "hop": "player", "height": 8 },
      "captain[angry]: OW!",
      { "camera": "pan", "x": 9, "y": 12, "duration": 400 },
      "A crab. A small, furious crab has clamped itself onto the door handle.",
      "captain[angry]: Where did YOU come from?!",
      { "sfx": "crab_snap" },
      "The crab regards you with the calm of a creature that has made its choice.",
      { "sfx": "door_rattle" },
      { "shake": 1, "duration": 300 },
      { "sfx": "door_rattle" },
      "captain[angry]: Let GO, you little—",
      { "fly": "garrick", "to": [11, 12], "arc": 4, "duration": 400 },
      { "anim": "garrick", "name": "clutch" },
      { "face": "player", "dir": "right" },
      { "camera": "reset", "duration": 300 },
      "garrick[terrified]: Captain. Captain, it's coming. The quarterly results are coming.",
      { "goto": "buildup" }
    ],
    "buildup": [
      { "music": null, "fade": 400 },
      { "sfx": "pressure_build" },
      { "shake": 1, "duration": 2600, "to": 4, "async": true },
      { "propFx": "jiggle", "area": [1, 4, 18, 9], "duration": 2600, "intensity": 1, "async": true },
      { "sfx": "heartbeat" },
      "garrick[gastro]: Hnnnnnnnnnng.",
      { "emote": "player", "icon": "sweat" },
      { "sfx": "wood_strain" },
      "captain[alarmed]: Grumblegut, whatever you're doing, STOP DOING IT.",
      "garrick[terrified]: I'm not doing it, Captain! It's doing ME!",
      { "sfx": "heartbeat" },
      { "burst": "odor", "actor": "garrick", "count": 4 },
      { "wait": 600 },
      { "sfx": "toot_tiny" },
      { "wait": 900 },
      "...A tiny, polite little toot.",
      { "wait": 600 },
      "garrick[relieved]: ...Oh! Oh, that's all it was. Panic over, Capt—",
      { "wait": 500 },
      { "sfx": "pressure_build" },
      { "shake": 3, "duration": 1700, "to": 7, "async": true },
      { "anim": "garrick", "name": "panic" },
      { "sfx": "heartbeat" },
      "garrick[terrified]: ...No it isn't.",
      { "sfx": "crab_snap" },
      "Behind you, the crab lets go of the handle and bolts under the door. It knows.",
      { "wait": 900 },
      { "goto": "blast" }
    ],
    "blast": [
      { "flash": "#fff6c0", "duration": 260 },
      { "sfx": "blast" },
      { "shake": 8, "duration": 1600, "async": true },
      { "roll": 5, "duration": 1600, "async": true },
      { "setFlag": "grumblegut_gust" },
      { "burst": "fume", "x": 12, "y": 11, "count": 30 },
      { "burst": "coins", "x": 12, "y": 10, "count": 40 },
      { "burst": "gems", "x": 10, "y": 8, "count": 16 },
      { "burst": "splinters", "x": 12, "y": 11, "count": 18 },
      { "burst": "dust", "x": 5, "y": 5, "count": 12 },
      { "fumeCloud": "blast", "level": "light", "x": 1, "y": 4, "w": 18, "h": 9, "grow": 800, "async": true },
      { "anim": "player", "name": "fallen" },
      { "anim": "garrick", "name": "relief" },
      { "wait": 500 },
      { "flash": "#e0c848", "duration": 700 },
      { "sfx": "blast_tail" },
      { "burst": "fume", "x": 6, "y": 6, "count": 20 },
      { "burst": "fume", "x": 15, "y": 7, "count": 20 },
      { "wait": 1300 },
      { "transition": "crew_quarters", "spawn": "ladder", "hidePlayer": true, "then": "ch4.cut_quarters", "fade": 350, "keepMusic": true }
    ]
  },

