    { "burst": "fume", "x": 12, "y": 10, "count": 14 },
    { "face": "jim", "dir": "down" },
    "jim[disgusted]: That's no stew. That's EEL. That's my EEL!",
    "quill[coughing]: It's coming up through the floorboards!",
    "mags[angry]: EVERYBODY UP! Grab the biscuits!",
    { "parallel": [
      [{ "move": "mags", "to": [13, 5], "speed": "run" }, { "move": "mags", "to": [14, 4], "speed": "run" }, { "despawn": "mags" }],
      [{ "move": "jim", "to": [14, 5], "speed": "run" }, { "wait": 400 }, { "move": "jim", "path": ["up", 1], "speed": "run" }, { "despawn": "jim" }],
      [{ "wait": 300 }, { "move": "quill", "to": [15, 5], "speed": "run" }, { "wait": 600 }, { "despawn": "quill" }]
    ] },
    { "sfx": "ladder" },
    { "setFlag": "galley_evacuated" },
    { "wait": 400 },
    "The stew pot bubbles on, alone, in a kitchen that smells like the bottom of the sea.",
    { "transition": "main_deck", "spawn": "main_hatch", "hidePlayer": true, "then": "ch4.cut_deck", "fade": 350, "keepMusic": true }
  ],

